        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "original": "「@t63@d1ま、それでも男子諸君は、ボクより鷺澤や未羽と交際したほうが幸せでしょ。二人とも可愛さの塊みたいな存在ですからねえ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「@t63@d1Yah, kurasa anak laki-laki bakal lebih bahagia kalau pacaran sama Sagisawa atau Miu daripada denganku. Mereka berdua kan ibarat gumpalan keimutan yang berjalan」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "original": "「まぁそれは認める。でも白河だって可愛いと思うぞ。昨日の、一心不乱にねこあるきの看板に見入っていたところなんて――」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Yah, aku setuju soal itu. Tapi aku merasa Shirakawa-san juga imut kok. Contohnya kemarin, waktu kamu terpaku memandangi papan iklan Neko Aruki-」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "original": "「とーきーさーかーあーにー？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「To-ki-sa-ka-Ka-ni-？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "original": "「す、すまんすまん。冗談だ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ma-Maaf, maaf. Cuma bercanda kok」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "original": "「まったく、あれは迂闊だった。これからちょこちょこいじられてしまいそうだよ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Duh, yang kemarin itu benar-benar kecerobohanku. Sepertinya ke depannya aku bakal sering digoda soal itu」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "original": "白河が少し拗ねつつ飲み物に口をつける。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Shirakawa-san meminum minumannya sambil sedikit merajuk.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "original": "いつも飄々としているだけに、こういう姿は破壊力抜群の可愛さだ。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Karena biasanya dia selalu terlihat tenang, pemandangan seperti ini punya daya hancur keimutan yang luar biasa.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "original": "それを言ったら叱られそうだから言わないけど。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Tapi aku tidak akan mengatakannya, karena dia pasti bakal memarahiku.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "original": "@t77@d1「しかし、こうなるともっと大きな括りでキミの好みをリサーチした方がいいのかも。常坂兄、ご趣味は？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t77@d1「Tapi kalau begini, mungkin aku harus meriset preferensimu dalam cakupan yang lebih luas. Tokisaka-ani, apa hobimu？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "original": "「お見合いかよ……。うーん、趣味かぁ……」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Berasa lagi sesi perjodohan saja... Hmm, hobi ya...」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
