        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "original": "「そうだなぁ……ＫｏｔｏＲＩの動画を見るのは好きだ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Hmm... Aku suka nonton video-video KotoRi」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "original": "俺がそう言うと、白河の眉がぴくっと動いた。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Begitu aku mengatakannya, alis Shirakawa sedikit berkedut.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "original": "「@t28@d1ＫｏｔｏＲＩ……？というと、バーチャルマイチューバーのＫｏｔｏＲＩさん？」",
        "translations": {
