            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "original": "白河もＫｏｔｏＲＩのファンなら、同じ趣味の話で盛り上がれると思ったんだけど残念だ。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Tadinya aku pikir kalau Shirakawa juga fans KotoRI, kami bisa asyik ngobrol soal hobi yang sama, tapi sayang sekali.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
