            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 118,
        "original": "そう言うと、白河は勢いよく立ち上がる。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Setelah mengatakan itu, Shirakawa berdiri dengan penuh semangat.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 119,
        "original": "そして自分の分の代金を置いて、さっさと店から出て行ってしまった。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Lalu dia meletakkan uang bayarannya sendiri dan bergegas pergi meninggalkan kafe.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
